message: >-
  Please cite this software artifact and the upstream methods used by your
  experiment. See CITATIONS.bib and THIRD_PARTY.md for component citations.
title: "STL Repair: Semantic Repair of Signal Temporal Logic Specifications"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous"
abstract: >-
  A research framework for semantic STL formula repair using responsibility-
  guided localization, repair edits, counterexample classification, and
  distinguishing-trace generation.
keywords:
  - signal temporal logic
  - automated program repair
  - counterexample classification
  - specification repair

